@ 0 3 0 1f9549fa60e511ed0d3bff4c27911dbd
+ 三者分别写出 `{"by":"a bear","kind":"Pursued"}`、`{"Pursued":{"by":"a bear"}}` 和 `{"type":"Pursued","value":{"by":"a bear"}}`。[标签联合](../../soundness/modules/json.md#tagged-unions)介绍了每种约定。
